  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><span style=\"font-family:var(--font-primary);font-size:var(--font-size-14)\">You call upon your dragonmark's power to better uncover secrets.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:var(--font-primary);font-size:var(--font-size-14)\">When you Cast the Spell, any time you</span><span style=\"font-family:var(--font-primary);font-size:var(--font-size-14)\"> @Compendium[pf2e.actionspf2e.1OagaWtBpVXExToo]{Recall Knowledge}, @Compendium[pf2e.actionspf2e.BlAOM2X92SI6HMtJ]{Seek}, or @Compendium[pf2e.actionspf2e.1xRFPTFtWtGJ9ELw]{Sense Motive} you gain a +1 status bonus to the skill or Perception used for the roll. This bonus remains as long as you @Compendium[pf2e.actionspf2e.3f5DMFu8fPiqHpRg]{Sustain the Spell}.</span></p>\n<hr style=\"border-top:1px solid var(--color-border-light-primary);border-bottom:1px solid var(--color-border-light-highlight)\" />\n<p class=\"hang\"><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> You do not need to sustain Deductive Intuition.</p>\n<p class=\"hang\"><strong>Heightened (5th)</strong> The bonus increases to +2.</p>\n<p class=\"hang\"><strong>Heightened (7th)</strong> The duration is 1 hour.</p>\n<p class=\"hang\"><strong>Heightened (9th)</strong> The bonus increases to +3.</p>\n<p class=\"hang\">@UUID[Compendium.pathfinders-guide-to-eberron-compendium.eberron-effects.c5EPKjwLrnSMDZC2]{Spell Effect: Deductive Intuition}</p>"
    },
